  "title": "pcapng: Plug two more memory leaks on error paths.",
  "description": "Free memory to prevent leaks on two error paths.  One was a simple omission in\npcapng_process_options; The other occurs where pcapng_read_custom_block\nreceives a WTAP_ERR_REC_MALFORMED error from the custom block handler but we\nare going to continue anyway, whereupon we failed to clear out the err_info\nstring which would subsequently leak.",
