      "title": "pcapng: Plug two more memory leaks on error paths.",
      "message": "pcapng: Plug two more memory leaks on error paths.\n\nFree memory to prevent leaks on two error paths.  One was a simple omission in\npcapng_process_options; The other occurs where pcapng_read_custom_block\nreceives a WTAP_ERR_REC_MALFORMED error from the custom block handler but we\nare going to continue anyway, whereupon we failed to clear out the err_info\nstring which would subsequently leak.\n",
      "author_name": "Darius Davis",
      "author_email": "darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au",
      "authored_date": "2025-09-10T07:42:59.000+10:00",
      "committer_name": "Michael Mann",
      "committer_email": "mmann78@netscape.net",
